<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 26/27.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 26/27.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, May 27 on Monday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   27.05.97	  26.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5572	    6.5100</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3733	    2.3654</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.6202	    4.6112</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4507	    3.4547</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5269	    0.5276</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7863	    0.7827</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2967	    0.2957</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0534	    7.0410</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6950	    0.6952	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2480	    1.2319</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
